                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I completed the game in a little over an hour.\n\nI had a good time, the story provided good enough incentive to keep going, and left a satisfying conclusion.\n\nThe game was very difficult, but by the last level I was at the edge of my seat once I got the timing down for the rotating rings. I like the multiple paths, some which favor data (which you need to complete the level), and others favor oxygen. If you keep dying in one path, you can usually switch gears and try a new direction.\n\nI appreciate the game being free, and theres plenty of potential to expand apon for a sequal / dlc.\n\nGood work!",
